message: >-
  If you use Uni-PreFusion in your research, please cite this repository and
  acknowledge the upstream projects listed in the documentation. This citation
  describes the software repository and does not assert journal acceptance or
  publication of the associated manuscript.
type: software
title: "Uni-PreFusion: A Height-Aware Pre-Lifting LiDAR-Camera Fusion Frontend for Unified Autonomous Driving"
authors:
