repository-code: "https://github.com/FangWD520/Uni-PreFusion"
url: "https://github.com/FangWD520/Uni-PreFusion"
abstract: >-
  Uni-PreFusion introduces height-aware pre-lifting LiDAR-camera fusion for
  unified autonomous driving. Sparse LiDAR voxels are compressed into
  height-aware pillar tokens for interaction with dense multi-view image
  features before depth-based lifting. Residual broadcasting restores refined
  pillar context to the original sparse voxels. The framework integrates this
  frontend with a UniLION-style sparse temporal backbone for detection, BEV map
  segmentation, occupancy prediction, motion forecasting, and planning.
keywords:
  - autonomous driving
  - LiDAR-camera fusion
  - pre-lifting fusion
  - height-aware representation
  - multi-task perception
  - temporal sparse reasoning
